# Uncomment and set the approver handles, then enable "Require review from Code Owners"
# in the branch protection rule for the default branch. This is what makes gate
# approvals human-only at the repository level; the scaffold check alone cannot tell who
# wrote a line.

# /GATES.md                 @<approver-handle>
# /docs/acceptance.json     @<approver-handle>
# /.scaffold.json           @<approver-handle>
# /scripts/                 @<approver-handle>
# /.github/                 @<approver-handle>
